        body:['“Build a knowledge assistant” is a solution description, not a use case. Strong framing starts with a user, a recurring task, a current cost, and a decision that can improve.','The best pilot is consequential enough to matter but bounded enough to diagnose. It uses known sources, representative questions, and a clear route to human help when confidence is insufficient.'],
        workflow:['Name the user, moment, and decision.','Quantify the current friction or risk.','Define what the pilot will and will not answer.','List required sources, owners, and approval boundaries.','Choose leading quality measures and a business outcome.'],
