        lab:{title:'Write a pilot charter',task:'Write a six-sentence charter covering user, decision, current friction, scope, non-goals, and success. Add three representative questions and one question the system must refuse.',deliverable:'A pilot charter that an executive, content owner, and engineer interpret the same way.'},
