        checklist:['Only approved sources enter the pipeline','Structure and identifiers survive parsing','Chunks retain enough context','Retrieval decisions are logged','Answers can be traced to exact evidence'],
        check:{q:'A retrieved chunk contains steps but loses the prerequisite in its parent section. Which stage most likely needs redesign?',options:['Brand voice','Chunking and context preservation','Final typography','User authentication'],answer:1,explanation:'The system created a unit that is retrievable but not independently interpretable. Chunking or parent-context assembly should preserve the prerequisite.'}
