        checklist:['Eligibility is decided before relevance','Exact identifiers receive lexical support','Semantic retrieval handles paraphrases','Authority and freshness affect ranking','Abstention is possible when evidence is insufficient'],
        check:{q:'What should happen before semantic ranking?',options:['Select a friendlier tone','Apply hard eligibility rules','Generate a draft answer','Translate every source'],answer:1,explanation:'Eligibility rules remove content that must not be used—such as obsolete, unauthorized, or wrong-version sources—before relevance ranking.'}
