        body:['Evaluation begins with representative work, not a convenient metric. Build cases from real questions, failure logs, high-risk scenarios, long-tail variations, and adversarial inputs.','No single score is enough. Measure source eligibility, retrieval quality, groundedness, factuality, completeness, task success, usability, safety, latency, cost, and business outcome at the appropriate layers.'],
