        body:['Authority is contextual. Product documentation may govern supported behavior, a legal policy may govern commitments, and a regional policy may override a global one for a market.','Write precedence as executable rules where possible: approved beats draft; market-specific beats global for that market; current effective version beats superseded; policy beats informal guidance for regulated decisions.'],
